WEBVTT

00:00:03.500 --> 00:00:06.500 line:10%
Use a continental grip

00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:06.500 line:10%
Support the racket throat with the left hand

00:00:07.500 --> 00:00:10.000 line:10%
Tilt the racket face slightly

00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:10.000 line:10%
Turn slightly sideways

00:00:11.000 --> 00:00:13.500 line:10%
Lead toward the ball with the handle

00:00:11.500 --> 00:00:13.500 line:10%
Keep the wrist cocked and set

00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:15.500 line:10%
Drive your weight forward

00:00:14.500 --> 00:00:15.500 line:10%
Extend the left hand outward
